DESCRIPTION:WHAT: The core rising in the east above the hexagonal basalt co
 lumns of the old Bombo quarry\, with the ocean behind. The best core posit
 ion of the coastal set.\nPriority: Very high\n\nWHEN (Sydney time)\nNight 
 of Sat 10 Apr into Sun 11 Apr 2027.\nShoot window: 21:48 to 02:08 (core be
 tween 8° and 60° high\, sky fully dark\, moon down).\nBest composition: 
 about 23:43\, core 30° high in the ESE.\nArrive by 21:03 to set up and fo
 cus.\nSunset 17:40 · astronomical dusk 19:03 · astronomical dawn 04:52 
