 E\n01:30  altitude 52°\, azimuth 94° E\n02:00  altitude 58°\, azimuth 9
 0° E\n\nTIDES (BOM prediction\, Port Kembla)\nPort Kembla is the nearest 
 BOM standard port. Treat times as approximate for this site.\nHigh water S
