 p before astronomical dusk.\nPriority: Medium\n\nWHEN (Sydney time)\nNight
  of Sat 30 Oct into Sun 31 Oct 2027.\nShoot window: 20:54 to 22:49 (core b
 etween 8° and 60° high\, sky fully dark\, moon down).\nBest composition:
  about 20:59\, core 30° high in the WSW.\nArrive by 20:09 to set up and f
 ocus.\nSunset 19:24 · astronomical dusk 20:54 · astronomical dawn 04:30 
